[{"id":"dhaqa-54-39-0","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa okusite","en":"so taste"},{"bs":"okusi!","en":"taste!"},{"bs":"da okuse","en":"so that they may taste"},{"bs":"okusili su","en":"they tasted"}],"ref":"54:39","answerWord":"فَذُوقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4ee6d073afac3ee1b660.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Now taste My punishment after My warnings!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["فَذُوقُوا۟","عَذَابِى","وَنُذُرِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-3-181-19","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"okusite!","en":"(you all) taste!"},{"bs":"kušaju","en":"they taste"},{"bs":"pa je okusila","en":"so it tasted"},{"bs":"i kušate","en":"and you (all) taste"}],"ref":"3:181","answerWord":"ذُوقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/daf8c4eb9bc638eca660.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Verily Allah heard the saying of those who said, (when asked for contributions to the war): \"Allah, forsooth, is poor, and we are rich!\" We shall record their saying with their slaying of the prophets wrongfully and We shall say: Taste ye the punishment of burning!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["لَّقَدْ","سَمِعَ","ٱللَّهُ","قَوْلَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","فَقِيرٌ","وَنَحْنُ","أَغْنِيَآءُ","سَنَكْتُبُ","مَا","قَالُوا۟","وَقَتْلَهُمُ","ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ","بِغَيْرِ","حَقٍّ","وَنَقُولُ","ذُوقُوا۟","عَذَابَ","ٱلْحَرِيقِ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-8-50-10","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i okusite!","en":"and (you all) taste!"},{"bs":"okusi!","en":"taste!"},{"bs":"pa je okusila","en":"so it tasted"},{"bs":"da okuse","en":"so that they may taste"}],"ref":"8:50","answerWord":"وَذُوقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/c74013d0f78301472b1c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If thou couldst see how the angels receive those who disbelieve, smiting faces and their backs and (saying): Taste the punishment of burning!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","تَرَىٰٓ","إِذْ","يَتَوَفَّى","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","يَضْرِبُونَ","وُجُوهَهُمْ","وَأَدْبَٰرَهُمْ","وَذُوقُوا۟","عَذَابَ","ٱلْحَرِيقِ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-59-15-5","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"okusili su","en":"they tasted"},{"bs":"pa je okusila","en":"so it tasted"},{"bs":"pa okusite","en":"so taste"},{"bs":"pa neka ga okuse","en":"so let them taste it"}],"ref":"59:15","answerWord":"ذَاقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/8e71dccaa4709829d80c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On the likeness of those (who suffered) a short time before them, they taste the ill-effects of their own conduct, and theirs is painful punishment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["كَمَثَلِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِهِمْ","قَرِيبًا","ذَاقُوا۟","وَبَالَ","أَمْرِهِمْ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-44-56-1","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"kušaju","en":"they taste"},{"bs":"i okusite!","en":"and (you all) taste!"},{"bs":"okusi!","en":"taste!"},{"bs":"i kušate","en":"and you (all) taste"}],"ref":"44:56","answerWord":"يَذُوقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/6481dd6883a7ffa4c7c9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They taste not death therein, save the first death. And He hath saved them from the doom of hell,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["لَا","يَذُوقُونَ","فِيهَا","ٱلْمَوْتَ","إِلَّا","ٱلْمَوْتَةَ","ٱلْأُولَىٰ","وَوَقَىٰهُمْ","عَذَابَ","ٱلْجَحِيمِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-4-56-13","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"da okuse","en":"so that they may taste"},{"bs":"i kušate","en":"and you (all) taste"},{"bs":"pa je okusila","en":"so it tasted"},{"bs":"da okusi","en":"so that he/it may taste"}],"ref":"4:56","answerWord":"لِيَذُوقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/567e3bcf4b71e567b2f7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Those who disbelieve Our revelations, We shall expose them to the Fire. As often as their skins are consumed We shall exchange them for fresh skins that they may taste the torment. Lo! Allah is ever Mighty, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","سَوْفَ","نُصْلِيهِمْ","نَارًا","كُلَّمَا","نَضِجَتْ","جُلُودُهُم","بَدَّلْنَٰهُمْ","جُلُودًا","غَيْرَهَا","لِيَذُوقُوا۟","ٱلْعَذَابَ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","عَزِيزًا","حَكِيمًا"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-7-22-3","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"okusili su","en":"they (two) tasted"},{"bs":"i okusite!","en":"and (you all) taste!"},{"bs":"da okuse","en":"so that they may taste"},{"bs":"i kušate","en":"and you (all) taste"}],"ref":"7:22","answerWord":"ذَاقَا","answerSound":"audio/76a980ef357bbf88e48f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus did he lead them on with guile. And when they tasted of the tree their shame was manifest to them and they began to hide (by heaping) on themselves some of the leaves of the Garden. And their Lord called them, (saying): Did I not forbid you from that tree and tell you: Lo! Satan is an open enemy to you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["فَدَلَّىٰهُمَا","بِغُرُورٍ","فَلَمَّا","ذَاقَا","ٱلشَّجَرَةَ","بَدَتْ","لَهُمَا","سَوْءَٰتُهُمَا","وَطَفِقَا","يَخْصِفَانِ","عَلَيْهِمَا","مِن","وَرَقِ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","وَنَادَىٰهُمَا","رَبُّهُمَآ","أَلَمْ","أَنْهَكُمَا","عَن","تِلْكُمَا","ٱلشَّجَرَةِ","وَأَقُل","لَّكُمَآ","إِنَّ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنَ","لَكُمَا","عَدُوٌّ","مُّبِينٌ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-16-94-9","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i kušate","en":"and you (all) taste"},{"bs":"kušaju","en":"they taste"},{"bs":"pa je okusila","en":"so it tasted"},{"bs":"pa neka ga okuse","en":"so let them taste it"}],"ref":"16:94","answerWord":"وَتَذُوقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/6be6f88ede0be0ec49e6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Make not your oaths a deceit between you, lest a foot should slip after being firmly planted and ye should taste evil forasmuch as ye debarred (men) from the way of Allah, and yours should be an awful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟","أَيْمَٰنَكُمْ","دَخَلًۢا","بَيْنَكُمْ","فَتَزِلَّ","قَدَمٌۢ","بَعْدَ","ثُبُوتِهَا","وَتَذُوقُوا۟","ٱلسُّوٓءَ","بِمَا","صَدَدتُّمْ","عَن","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَكُمْ","عَذَابٌ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-38-8-13","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"kušaju","en":"they taste"},{"bs":"okusi!","en":"taste!"},{"bs":"pa okusite","en":"so taste"},{"bs":"pa neka ga okuse","en":"so let them taste it"}],"ref":"38:8","answerWord":"يَذُوقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4028ad9c298d98c46ba3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hath the reminder been unto him (alone) among us? Nay, but they are in doubt concerning My reminder; nay but they have not yet tasted My doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["أَءُنزِلَ","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلذِّكْرُ","مِنۢ","بَيْنِنَا","بَلْ","هُمْ","فِى","شَكٍّ","مِّن","ذِكْرِى","بَل","لَّمَّا","يَذُوقُوا۟","عَذَابِ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-38-57-1","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa neka ga okuse","en":"so let them taste it"},{"bs":"okusite!","en":"(you all) taste!"},{"bs":"kušaju","en":"they taste"},{"bs":"i kušate","en":"and you (all) taste"}],"ref":"38:57","answerWord":"فَلْيَذُوقُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/2ad6160d9b7eeda3a40e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Here is a boiling and an ice-cold draught, so let them taste it,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["هَٰذَا","فَلْيَذُوقُوهُ","حَمِيمٌ","وَغَسَّاقٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-44-49-0","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"okusi!","en":"taste!"},{"bs":"kušaju","en":"they taste"},{"bs":"da okusi","en":"so that he/it may taste"},{"bs":"okusite!","en":"(you all) taste!"}],"ref":"44:49","answerWord":"ذُقْ","answerSound":"audio/4a97964fcb189b6a4dac.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Saying): Taste! Lo! thou wast forsooth the mighty, the noble!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["ذُقْ","إِنَّكَ","أَنتَ","ٱلْعَزِيزُ","ٱلْكَرِيمُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"dhaqa-65-9-0","words":["verb:dhaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je okusila","en":"so it tasted"},{"bs":"i kušate","en":"and you (all) taste"},{"bs":"pa neka ga okuse","en":"so let them taste it"},{"bs":"i okusite!","en":"and (you all) taste!"}],"ref":"65:9","answerWord":"فَذَاقَتْ","answerSound":"audio/5606756aa64be4f6437c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So that it tasted the ill-effects of its conduct, and the consequence of its conduct was loss.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okusiti","en":"to taste"},"passage":["فَذَاقَتْ","وَبَالَ","أَمْرِهَا","وَكَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","أَمْرِهَا","خُسْرًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"ذاقَ"}},{"id":"awratha-7-137-0","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavili smo u nasljedstvo","en":"and we bequeathed"},{"bs":"i ostavio vas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed you (all)"},{"bs":"ostavljeni su u nasljedstvo","en":"they were bequeathed"},{"bs":"ostavlja je u nasljedstvo","en":"he/it bequeaths it"}],"ref":"7:137","answerWord":"وَأَوْرَثْنَا","answerSound":"audio/b3c90cd8f93cf6c89a65.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We caused the folk who were despised to inherit the eastern parts of the land and the western parts thereof which We had blessed. And the fair word of thy Lord was fulfilled for the Children of Israel because of their endurance; and We annihilated (all) that Pharaoh and his folk had done and that they had contrived.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["وَأَوْرَثْنَا","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَانُوا۟","يُسْتَضْعَفُونَ","مَشَٰرِقَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَمَغَٰرِبَهَا","ٱلَّتِى","بَٰرَكْنَا","فِيهَا","وَتَمَّتْ","كَلِمَتُ","رَبِّكَ","ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","عَلَىٰ","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","بِمَا","صَبَرُوا۟","وَدَمَّرْنَا","مَا","كَانَ","يَصْنَعُ","فِرْعَوْنُ","وَقَوْمُهُۥ","وَمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْرِشُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"awratha-26-59-1","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"i dali smo ga u nasljedstvo","en":"and We gave it as inheritance"},{"bs":"i ostavili smo u nasljedstvo","en":"and we bequeathed"},{"bs":"dajemo u nasljedstvo","en":"We give as inheritance"},{"bs":"i ostavio nas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed us"}],"ref":"26:59","answerWord":"وَأَوْرَثْنَٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/359629257e2fbf1ce714.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus (were those things taken from them) and We caused the Children of Israel to inherit them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["كَذَٰلِكَ","وَأَوْرَثْنَٰهَا","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"awratha-7-128-9","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavlja je u nasljedstvo","en":"he/it bequeaths it"},{"bs":"dajemo u nasljedstvo","en":"We give as inheritance"},{"bs":"i ostavio nas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed us"},{"bs":"i ostavio vas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed you (all)"}],"ref":"7:128","answerWord":"يُورِثُهَا","answerSound":"audio/633da6c05199aed845ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Moses said unto his people: Seek help in Allah and endure. Lo! the earth is Allah's. He giveth it for an inheritance to whom He will. And lo! the sequel is for those who keep their duty (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["قَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","لِقَوْمِهِ","ٱسْتَعِينُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱصْبِرُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","لِلَّهِ","يُورِثُهَا","مَن","يَشَآءُ","مِنْ","عِبَادِهِۦ","وَٱلْعَٰقِبَةُ","لِلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"awratha-19-63-3","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"dajemo u nasljedstvo","en":"We give as inheritance"},{"bs":"i ostavili smo u nasljedstvo","en":"and we bequeathed"},{"bs":"i ostavio nas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed us"},{"bs":"ostavlja je u nasljedstvo","en":"he/it bequeaths it"}],"ref":"19:63","answerWord":"نُورِثُ","answerSound":"audio/fa00fe259b2d120371ae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Such is the Garden which We cause the devout among Our bondmen to inherit.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["تِلْكَ","ٱلْجَنَّةُ","ٱلَّتِى","نُورِثُ","مِنْ","عِبَادِنَا","مَن","كَانَ","تَقِيًّا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"awratha-33-27-0","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavio vas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed you (all)"},{"bs":"i dali smo ga u nasljedstvo","en":"and We gave it as inheritance"},{"bs":"dajemo u nasljedstvo","en":"We give as inheritance"},{"bs":"i ostavili smo u nasljedstvo","en":"and we bequeathed"}],"ref":"33:27","answerWord":"وَأَوْرَثَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/96ff827d13bf8c002064.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He caused you to inherit their land and their houses and their wealth, and land ye have not trodden. Allah is ever Able to do all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["وَأَوْرَثَكُمْ","أَرْضَهُمْ","وَدِيَٰرَهُمْ","وَأَمْوَٰلَهُمْ","وَأَرْضًا","لَّمْ","تَطَـُٔوهَا","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"awratha-35-32-1","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavili smo u nasljedstvo","en":"we bequeathed"},{"bs":"ostavljeni su u nasljedstvo","en":"they were bequeathed"},{"bs":"i ostavio vas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed you (all)"},{"bs":"dajemo u nasljedstvo","en":"We give as inheritance"}],"ref":"35:32","answerWord":"أَوْرَثْنَا","answerSound":"audio/54352d90ed11550cebf7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We gave the Scripture as inheritance unto those whom We elected of Our bondmen. But of them are some who wrong themselves and of them are some who are lukewarm, and of them are some who outstrip (others) through good deeds, by Allah's leave. That is the great favour!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","أَوْرَثْنَا","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱصْطَفَيْنَا","مِنْ","عِبَادِنَا","فَمِنْهُمْ","ظَالِمٌ","لِّنَفْسِهِۦ","وَمِنْهُم","مُّقْتَصِدٌ","وَمِنْهُمْ","سَابِقٌۢ","بِٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ","بِإِذْنِ","ٱللَّهِ","ذَٰلِكَ","هُوَ","ٱلْفَضْلُ","ٱلْكَبِيرُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"awratha-39-74-6","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"i ostavio nas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed us"},{"bs":"i ostavili smo u nasljedstvo","en":"and we bequeathed"},{"bs":"ostavlja je u nasljedstvo","en":"he/it bequeaths it"},{"bs":"i ostavio vas je u nasljedstvo","en":"and he/it bequeathed you (all)"}],"ref":"39:74","answerWord":"وَأَوْرَثَنَا","answerSound":"audio/db29d0a4cf730ace6d79.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They say: Praise be to Allah, Who hath fulfilled His promise unto us and hath made us inherit the land, sojourning in the Garden where we will! So bounteous is the wage of workers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["وَقَالُوا۟","ٱلْحَمْدُ","لِلَّهِ","ٱلَّذِى","صَدَقَنَا","وَعْدَهُۥ","وَأَوْرَثَنَا","ٱلْأَرْضَ","نَتَبَوَّأُ","مِنَ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","حَيْثُ","نَشَآءُ","فَنِعْمَ","أَجْرُ","ٱلْعَٰمِلِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"awratha-42-14-22","words":["verb:awratha"],"options":[{"bs":"ostavljeni su u nasljedstvo","en":"they were bequeathed"},{"bs":"ostavili smo u nasljedstvo","en":"we bequeathed"},{"bs":"ostavlja je u nasljedstvo","en":"he/it bequeaths it"},{"bs":"i dali smo ga u nasljedstvo","en":"and We gave it as inheritance"}],"ref":"42:14","answerWord":"أُورِثُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/ee6d484b670e43191a97.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they were not divided until after the knowledge came unto them, through rivalry among themselves; and had it not been for a Word that had already gone forth from thy Lord for an appointed term, it surely had been judged between them. And those who were made to inherit the Scripture after them are verily in hopeless doubt concerning it.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"ostaviti u nasljedstvo","en":"to bequeath, to give as inheritance"},"passage":["وَمَا","تَفَرَّقُوٓا۟","إِلَّا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","جَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْعِلْمُ","بَغْيًۢا","بَيْنَهُمْ","وَلَوْلَا","كَلِمَةٌ","سَبَقَتْ","مِن","رَّبِّكَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","مُّسَمًّى","لَّقُضِىَ","بَيْنَهُمْ","وَإِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُورِثُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِمْ","لَفِى","شَكٍّ","مِّنْهُ","مُرِيبٍ"],"marked":[22],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْرَثَ"}},{"id":"izdada-3-178-12","words":["verb:izdada"],"options":[{"bs":"da se povećaju","en":"so that they may increase"},{"bs":"povećali su se","en":"they increased"},{"bs":"i povećava se","en":"and he/it increases"},{"bs":"i povećavamo se","en":"and we increase"}],"ref":"3:178","answerWord":"لِيَزْدَادُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/7bfbfbd0e5f2e98444ea.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And let not those who disbelieve imagine that the rein We give them bodeth good unto their souls. We only give them rein that they may grow in sinfulness. And theirs will be a shameful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati se, rasti","en":"to increase, to grow"},"passage":["وَلَا","يَحْسَبَنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","أَنَّمَا","نُمْلِى","لَهُمْ","خَيْرٌ","لِّأَنفُسِهِمْ","إِنَّمَا","نُمْلِى","لَهُمْ","لِيَزْدَادُوٓا۟","إِثْمًا","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","مُّهِينٌ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"ازْدَادَ"}},{"id":"izdada-12-65-19","words":["verb:izdada"],"options":[{"bs":"i povećavamo se","en":"and we increase"},{"bs":"i povećava se","en":"and he/it increases"},{"bs":"i dodali su","en":"and they added"},{"bs":"da se povećaju","en":"so that they may increase"}],"ref":"12:65","answerWord":"وَنَزْدَادُ","answerSound":"audio/e9a882a8d89a737d0886.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they opened their belongings they discovered that their merchandise had been returned to them. They said: O our father! What (more) can we ask? Here is our merchandise returned to us. We shall get provision for our folk and guard our brother, and we shall have the extra measure of a camel (load). This (that we bring now) is a light measure.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povećati se, rasti","en":"to increase, to grow"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","فَتَحُوا۟","مَتَٰعَهُمْ","وَجَدُوا۟","بِضَٰعَتَهُمْ","رُدَّتْ","إِلَيْهِمْ","قَالُوا۟","يَٰٓأَبَانَا","مَا","نَبْغِى","هَٰذِهِۦ","بِضَٰعَتُنَا","رُدَّتْ","إِلَيْنَا","وَنَمِيرُ","أَهْلَنَا","وَنَحْفَظُ","أَخَانَا","وَنَزْدَادُ","كَيْلَ","بَعِيرٍ","ذَٰلِكَ","كَيْلٌ","يَسِيرٌ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"ازْدَادَ"}}]